ind":"announcement","title":"Final DEMO.","summary":"With the release of Chapter One just around the corner, we’ve decided to give you an expanded demo.It includes the prologue and part of Chapter One, where you’ll meet three of the five companions and may find yourself dying more times than you’d care to.We’ve also added new fonts to make the game easier to read. You can switch between them in the game’s settings.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:50:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234693","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994560-1835871199310941","game_id":"steam-3994560","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO updated ver. 1.2","summary":"QOL Updates for the DemoThanks to the feedback from friends, communities, and Reddit users.Added a customizable textbox background to improve readability. One of the main issues was that text could be difficult to read against the highly detailed black-and-white backgrounds, especially in English. Now you can adjust the textbox transparency to your preference. If readability is not a major concern and you'd rather fully enjoy the artwork, you can make it completely transparent.Updated some of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T13:27:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994560-1834602721192453","game_id":"steam-3994560","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo for \"Sirin's Feather\" Is Now Available!","summary":"We're excited to announce that the free demo of Sirin's Feather is now available to download! You can get it either from the main game page or from the dedicated demo page.After playing, you can leave your feedback directly on the demo page - we'd love to hear your thoughts.The demo introduces the beginning of the story, where you'll learn how Vanya lost the most precious thing he had and received a mysterious feather in return - one that will change his fate forever.A special thank you to every","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T23:19:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721192453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3994560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3994560":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3994560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z"},"4695430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3994560","app_id":3994560,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"dfe7f11af229f0f89668bb593c162824f8b46a44d386abc5e41cfeb6dd601731","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"죽음의 새가 당신의 사랑하는 이를 빼앗았습니다.\r\n그녀를 되찾기 위해, 당신은 얼마나 많은 죽음을 반복해야 할까요?\r\n동료를 모으고, 그들의 비밀을 밝혀내며, 이교도의 신화가 살아 숨 쉬는 세계에서 이야기를 만들어가세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Pale Laska"}],"developers":[{"name":"Pale Laska"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":17987040